OL,4,BWoods to design new golf course in     
OL,5,BNorthern Ireland                       
OL,6,GTiger Woods is to design Northern      
OL,7,GIreland's first new championship links 
OL,8,Ggolf course in more than a century.    
OL,10,FOn Thursday, Woods and his course      
OL,11,Farchitecture firm TGR Design unveiled  
OL,12,Fplans for Bellarena Golf Links on the  
OL,13,FCauseway Coast.                        
OL,15,FThe course will be located on Northern 
OL,16,FIreland's north-west coast, about 20   
OL,17,Fmiles west of three-time Open          
OL,18,FChampionship venue Royal Portrush.     
